      "normative_level": "SHOULD",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "client",
      "stage": "rtsp_fsm",
      "description": "In particular, robot agents SHOULD include this header so that the person responsible for running the robot can be contacted if problems occur on the receiving end.",
